# ThreadSphere Project Rules

## Stack
- **Frontend:** `apps/web` — Next.js App Router, Tailwind, Server Components by default
- **Backend:** `apps/api` — Express + Socket.io, TypeScript ESM
- **Shared:** `packages/shared` — Zod schemas, constants (import as `@threadsphere/shared`)

## Conventions
- Minimize scope; match existing patterns in each app
- All user input validated server-side with shared Zod schemas — never trust client-only validation
- Store rich content as sanitized HTML + plain text for search
- Thread tags: 1–5 required per thread; validate tag IDs/slugs on backend
- Use httpOnly JWT cookies for auth (no localStorage tokens)
- Realtime via Socket.io rooms: `user:{id}`, `thread:{id}`, `community:{id}`, `dm:{id}`

## Progress Tracking
- Update `docs/PROGRESS.md` at end of each session (task status + session log)
- Prefer Graphify queries (`graphify query "..."`) over grepping for architecture questions

## UI Reference
- 3-column layout: left sidebar (communities/filters), center feed, right widgets
- Primary accent: deep red for CTAs
- Key pages: home, community, thread detail, profile, search, notifications, create community wizard

## Commands
```bash
npm run dev          # Turbo dev (web + api)
npm run typecheck    # TypeScript
docker compose up -d # Postgres + Redis
```
